sequenceDiagram
    participant Role as IAM Role<br/>(AmazonSSMManagedInstanceCore)
    participant EC2 as EC2 Instance<br/>+ SSM Agent
    participant SSM as AWS Systems Manager
    participant You as আপনি (Console/CLI)
    participant Logs as CloudWatch Logs / S3

    Role->>EC2: Instance Profile attach (permission দেয়)
    EC2->>SSM: Outbound HTTPS (443) — কোনো inbound port লাগে না
    You->>SSM: Session Manager শুরু করুন
    SSM->>EC2: Encrypted shell session
    EC2-->>You: Interactive shell (browser/CLI-তে)
    SSM->>Logs: সব session log হয় (audit)

    You->>SSM: Run Command পাঠান
    SSM->>EC2: Command execute
    EC2-->>SSM: Output রিটার্ন

    Note over SSM: Patch Manager একই agent ব্যবহার করে<br/>scheduled patching করে
